  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways for Better Education and Livelihoods in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &apos;Conflict-affected Palestinian youth (14-29) have enhanced wellbeing, access to continued education and able to generate their income&apos; aims at enhancing access to employment by fortifying the education system and livelihood pathways through the reinforcement of TVET systems alongside fostering greater youth engagement and community involvemen. The Palestinian TVET, UNRWA and the MoEHE are the main partners for Norwegian Refugee Council - Palestine under this project.</narrative>
  </description>
